        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2503.07334">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2503.07334">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2503.07334">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
