        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.08151">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2405.08151">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2405.08151">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
